oriya","html_url":"https://github.com/harshnagoriya/Wine-Quality-Prediction","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"It\u2019s a known fact that older the wine, better the taste. However, there are several factors other than age that go into wine quality certification which include physiochemical tests like alcohol quantity, fixed acidity, volatile acidity, determination of density, pH and more. The main goal of this machine learning project is to build a machine learning model to predict the quality of wines by exploring their various chemical properties. Wine quality dataset consists of 4898 observations with 11 independent and 1 dependent variable.","topics":[],"score":221999,"global_rank":183940},{"name":"rituparrna33/Visualizing_Covid_19_Data","owner":"rituparrna33","html_url":"https://github.com/rituparrna33/Visualizing_Covid_19_Data","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Visualizing Covid 19 cases:you will visualize COVID-19 data from the first several weeks of the outbreak to see at what point this virus became a global pandemic","topics":["dplyr","ggplot2","summary","visualization"],"score":221994,"global_rank":183976},{"name":"yiihuang/car-evaluation-clustering","owner":"yiihuang","html_url":"https://github.com/yiihuang/car-evaluation-clustering","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":221992,"global_rank":184017},{"name":"marichard/calculator","owner":"marichard","html_url":"https://github.com/marichard/calculator","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Simple calculator project.","topics":[],"score":221992,"global_rank":184018},{"name":"jianhui-ben/visitor_management_system","owner":"jianhui-ben","html_url":"https://github.com/jianhui-ben/visitor_management_system","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Noteboo